        "statement": "(“Outfitter”), we provide Mobile Satellite Services (“MSS”) solutions to fulfill the growing global demand for satellite-enabled voice, data, personnel and asset tracking, Machine-to-Machine (“M2M”) and Internet of Things (“IoT”) connectivity services.",
